OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FRain will soon clear from the
OL,6,Ffar southeast of England, whilst
OL,7,Fgradually easing across northern
OL,8,FScotland. Otherwise Wednesday will
OL,9,Fbring sunshine and showers. Showers
OL,10,Flocally heavy, especially in the north
OL,11,Fwhere hail and thunder possible.
OL,12,FGenerally cooler than of late.
OL,13,
OL,14,CTonight:FThere will be a mix of clear
OL,15,Fspells and showers overnight, the
OL,16,Fshowers heaviest and most widespread
OL,17,Facross northern England and north
OL,18,FWales. Chilly in some rural parts of
OL,19,FScotland.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
