OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CThursday:FThursday will be another day
OL,6,Fof sunshine and showers. The focus for
OL,7,Fthe heaviest showers will transfer
OL,8,Fsouth to England and Wales. Thunder
OL,9,Fpossible. Feeling cool in the
OL,10,Fnortherly breeze.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
